/*
 * A library whose generic holds a `T?`. That is the whole point of the fixture: nothing in `stdlib/`
 * did until `result<T, E>`, and a user-declared generic never reaches it - its template and its
 * instantiation are in one unit, so there is only one `llvm::StructType` for the payload to be.
 */

